// src/v2/extdeps/languages/ecmascript.dag
// Scope: ECMAScript ES2022 (ECMA-262 13th Edition) primitive fact-bundles + T-11 MVP-1 grammar-data target model.
// Owns: EcmascriptSingletonKind, EcmascriptScalar, EcmascriptCost,
//   EcmascriptGrammarRelationRow, EcmascriptLanguageModel, EcmascriptNumberPrimitiveFacts,
//   EcmascriptBigIntPrimitiveFacts, EcmascriptBooleanPrimitiveFacts, EcmascriptStringPrimitiveFacts,
//   EcmascriptSingletonPrimitiveFacts, ecmascript_language_model_wave1 (+ supporting fns).
// Consumes: v2.std.model_core, v2.std.collection, v2.std.node, v2.std.logic, v2.std.algebra,
//   v2.std.compilers.lexing, v2.std.grammar, v2.std.compilers.target_model, v2.std.witness, v2.std.text.
// Status: T-4.17 ecmascript slice (NEW) — ECMA-262 ES2022 primitives; ModelCore inhabitance for
//   number/bigint/boolean; string inhabitance deferred; laws/effects/partiality empty (wave-2b);
//   🟡 gated feature:T-6-token-layout-trivia-policy + feature:ecmascript-wave2a-decimal-int-literal
//   (decimal `0` | [1-9][0-9]* only; not 0b/0o/0x/numeric-separators); canonical_symbols via catalog
//   + wave-1 lex/grammar/MVP; bool canonical-B decl-ref — 🟡 E-6(b) staging. NO TypeScript type
//   annotations — base ES surface only; `typescript.dag` is the TS surface authority.
// Anchor: https://tc39.es/ecma262/2022/ (ECMA-262, 13th Edition, June 2022).
// Ledger: CP-3229-GREEN-TERMINAL, SL-T11-GRAMMAR-FROM-TOKEN-ROW.
// 🟡

